il_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 203508, "client_id": 1152356, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/99d4391b/uploads/origins/36976bd6-e963-424e-a7c2-ce55d0443b9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed4a7269229faa42429c7280bb377b06", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/99d4391b/uploads/origins/36976bd6-e963-424e-a7c2-ce55d0443b9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=db1fe79ebedfdfddcccfd27a53ba5df4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品がとても好きです。もし私のリクエストを検討していただけるなら、とても嬉しいです！\n\n私のキャラクターは日馬善哉というvtuberで、宇宙から来た生意気な姫司令官です。スポーツブラとヨガパンツのタイトな運動着でお願いします。タオルを持ちながら、汗をいっぱいかいてください。彼女は肩越しにウィンクしながら立っているはずです。\n\n彼女は背が低く、小さく、平らであることに注意してください。\n\nこれは私のソーシャルメディア用のイラストとして使われます！\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NoRX2peBsje5pKKAh7MVCZv9Xt6aBJrZ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rushia_n/works/129", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 203508, "client_id": 2864324, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce71f621/uploads/origins/43b8eaa4-aa0a-4ceb-aa9a-d657e8c172ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46aa653fe7b9268585fc616713264a73", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce71f621/uploads/origins/43b8eaa4-aa0a-4ceb-aa9a-d657e8c172ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3d61f175ff71793d089a6177962b4376", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めまして、るしあん様が描かれる下着の描写が好きなので下着をメインにOC二人のリクエストをさせていただきます。\n\n参考画像\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aVnJJruqR678biHpxri2rFTLzYnrQc6W?usp=sharing\n\n衣装\n制服\nポーズ\n上下の下着を見せつける。両者スカートはめくり上げて、お嬢様は胸の部分だけシャツを開ける。\nギャルは上着をずり上げる。\nその他\n下着、お嬢様は紫のレースでタイツは履いたまま透けてる感じ。ギャルはピンクのサテン。\n表情、お嬢様は無表情で少し赤くなってる。ギャルは恥ずかしすぎて赤面して俯く。\n斜め上からのアングル。\n薄暗くてセクシーな雰囲気。\n宛名有/無レイヤーのデータがあるとありがたいです。\n\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rushia_n/works/128", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 203508, "client_id": 1453478, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/46434487/uploads/origins/769251b2-fb62-447f-8385-9e8574e0496f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b40bf40a0573704941ec0c0528b2f21", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/46434487/uploads/origins/769251b2-fb62-447f-8385-9e8574e0496f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=965714e30834181717d340e974fdffca", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Thank you again for accepting my request. I like it very much! It's amazing!!\n\nI hope you're willing to consider my new request!\n\nDescription:\nI have attached sample pose in the Google Drive, landscape holding a glass of wine in the similar angle. If possible the outfit to be teasing and sexy. I have attached sample outfit. I will leave it to your choice if you wish to change the outfit or colour as I love the works you did for me! \n\nIf possible, could you provide data (PSD, etc.) that is layered with the background and the character? Thank you! \n\nThe art will be as follows:\n・ SNS Posting / Promotion\n・ SNS icons and headers\n・ YouTube / Twitch\n\nThank you so much for supporting me, I appreciate your time and work!\n\nTake care!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1Hh0NaduRntxsRfIFLxWeOmT9XEFyUxI8", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acce